      <section class="ent-sec" aria-labelledby="who-h">
        <h2 class="ent-eyebrow" id="who-h">Who it’s for</h2>
        <p class="ent-statement">Work is being reorganized around AI, and growing companies feel it first. They need revenue ops, finance and planning before they can afford to hire for them, while their people already use AI on their own, scattered across a dozen tools with no one steering it.</p>
        <p class="ent-body">OpenShore brings it into one place. Your team and expert workers share the same chats and projects. You message a worker like an employee, it does the work with sources, and a person approves every change. It runs on whatever models the company already uses, on its own keys.</p>
        <p class="ent-body">Our bet is that every company will soon divide its work between people and agents. Startups can build that way from day one, so we start there and grow with them.</p>
        <p class="ent-statement">Every Team — Every Agent. Working as One.</p>
      </section>

      <section class="ent-sec" aria-labelledby="price-h">
